sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser as Template / Browser
    participant View as View (note_create)
    participant Model as Model (Note)
    participant DB as SQLite Database

    User->>Browser: Fill note form and click Save
    Browser->>View: POST /note/new/ (title, content, csrf_token)
    activate View
    View->>View: Validate NoteForm (form.is_valid())
    View->>Model: Create instance (form.save())
    activate Model
    Model->>DB: INSERT INTO notes_note (title, content, created_at)
    activate DB
    DB-->>Model: Return new record ID
    deactivate DB
    Model-->>View: Return saved Note instance
    deactivate Model
    View-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect to note_list (/)
    deactivate View
    Browser->>View: GET / (request note list)
    activate View
    View->>DB: SELECT * FROM notes_note ORDER BY created_at DESC
    activate DB
    DB-->>View: QuerySet of notes
    deactivate DB
    View-->>Browser: Render note_list.html template (HTTP 200)
    deactivate View
    Browser-->>User: Display updated sticky notes list

